<title>USA: IPO FILING - Metropolitan Financial Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Metropolitan Financial Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name  Metropolitan Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Stock symbol			N/A</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9-11/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    700,000</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 400,000</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  300,000 Shrs outstanding after ipo    3,525,635</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    McDonald &amp; Co. Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  105,000 shrs Business: Holding company for Metropolitan Savings Bank of Cleveland, based in Mayfield Heights, Ohio. The company is wholly-owned by the selling shareholder, Robert Kaye, who will own 80.1 percent of the company (77.2 percent if the underwriter exercises its over-allotment option).</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Contributed as paid-in capital to the company's bank.</p>
